00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.140
C'mon, just give me a chance to boobs...

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.440
Ow, ow, ow...

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.360
What are you doing?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.280
That's my line.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.570
