00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.980
A woman?

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.250
Do I look like one?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:19.010
Then do you want to try me and find out?

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.260
You little...

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.390
