00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.010
Three days?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:05.470
I'm on a journey in search of something.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.520
A journey?

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.530
But I finally ran out of money.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:12.810
I see. That must've been difficult.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.360
By the way, what was going on back there?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:17.860
Back there?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.550
You were fighting someone, it seemed.

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:21.680
Yes.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.200
I couldn't just stand there 
watching him go after women.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.950
Go after women?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.060
Yes.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.830
I can't stand men like that.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.180
Thank you so much.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:37.850
This is the first time anyone has 
been so kind to me on my journey.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.300
Don't worry about it.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.380
We all help each other out 
when we're in trouble.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.510
No, I must repay you in some way.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.800
Otomi-dono,

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:50.150
