00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.510
Damn it!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.860
That creep won't get away with this.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:58.990
Yeah.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.280
Butting in when a guy's trying 
to score... It makes no sense.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.240
I wonder what that was about, though.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.280
What?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.840
It was a woman, but dressed like a man.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.620
You never see people like that.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.880
It don't care if they're unusual or not.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.580
If I ever see that man-woman again, I'll...

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.920
You'll what?

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.250
Kiriko!

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.630
You're not planning on leaving 
me for another woman, are you?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.090
Wait.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:28.030
I must protect your virginity.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.010
Please don't do anything selfish.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.120
What's selfish?

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.140
