00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.640
No, you do.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:39.820
We've confirmed the existence of 
the Susanoo's Beast God form.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:44.690
We need you to pilot the Susanoo and 
prepare for the battle with Shigeyoshi.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:47.340
I'm not getting in that thing!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.880
Why must I do this?

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.350
