00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.230
Not bad at all!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.160
Why don't we go for a quick—

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.780
You bastard!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.680
Okay, that's enough.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.010
Otomi-dono!

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.700
You're going to repay me, right?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.500
G-G-Grannie, who is this woman?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.370
And she's wearing the bathhouse uniform. Why?

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.580
<i>They don't recognize me?</i>

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.890
