00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:50.640
So get to work.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.050
Keiichiro, you show her what to do.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.290
W-Wait a second.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:57.340
Why do I have to work with him?

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.140
He's—

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.270
