00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.510
Killed?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.790
Six months ago...

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:48.650
My father was killed by someone unknown.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:53.840
