00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:20.440
But it also made me start to hate men.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:22.050
So when I saw you...

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:27.680
But still, a misunderstanding 
like that is unforgivable.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:31.040
