00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.200
But I have one clue.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.410
A clue?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.620
The killer bears the seal case of the Tokugawa.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.620
The seal case of the Tokugawa?

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.410
What's going on?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.270
What is this?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.340
