00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.980
Wait a minute... That seal case...

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.640
It's the Tokugawa's!

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.740
Oh, you were just talking about 
the Tokugawa, weren't you?

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.610
Was it...

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.870
Was it you?!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.280
Huh? What?

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.210
