Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.880
That was probably why he was assassinated.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.230
You killed my father!

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:55.680
H-Hold on! The boss never even knew your dad!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.640
It's all a misunderstanding!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.360
