00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.400
Don't screw with me!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.240
Die!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:39.460
I'm not weak!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.080
I can't move!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.670
I'm gonna rip...

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.640
