00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.780
You bastard!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.090
You...

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.880
He killed my father?

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.390
He...

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.300
He killed my father!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.310
Wh-What?

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.360
What?

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.070
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.820
