00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.410
Idiot! Get your hands off me!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.010
Damn it!

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.140
This isn't a Puppet...

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:05.520
