00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.780
Stop!

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:28.580
That's the end of that, then.

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.600
Grannie?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:35.440
<b>Bath</b>

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:41.140
What the hell happened?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.100
Susanoo moved of its own will.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.600
