00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:54.120
Susanoo has a soul.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:56.400
A soul, and a will.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.630
That will protected you.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:06.220
You sure love to jump to conclusions.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.250
But it worked out for the best.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.790
Keiichiro met someone stronger than him.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.090
I'm so sorry, Keiichiro-dono!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:21.010
How can I ever apologize to you?

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:29.560
I thought that whoever had the Tokugawa 
seal was the one who killed my father.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.770
But I was wrong.

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:33.430
He was telling me that the 
person who has Susanoo,

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:36.520
and who has the blood of the 
Tokugawa, is in Nagasaki.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.240
He wanted me to find them.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.610
I misjudged you twice.

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:44.160
I don't know how I can apologize to you!

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.330
I can't believe you did it twice.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.960
How ditzy can you be?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.120
Keiichiro-sama...

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.250
It'll be all right.

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:18.610
I'm sorry about what happened.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:21.490
Otomi-dono told me everything.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.450
Everything?

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:28.680
That you are fighting Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.950
And that my father's killer 
is connected with him.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:36.130
I'll be working here from now on, as well.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.670
I'll be needing your help again, I think.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.430
Keiichiro.

00:20:42.210 --> 00:20:45.390
Why did you save me during that battle?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.140
I tried to kill you. Why?

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.860
Saving women...

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.020
That's what makes a man, a man.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.280
<b>Women</b>

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:04.690
Come on, you're one of us now!

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:06.320
That has nothing to do with this!

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:09.210
It's not like it hurts you or anything!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.730
That's not the problem!

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:12.750
Oh, come on!

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:15.120
I've got a bad feeling...

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:18.580
What is this?

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:20.550
They're bigger than mine!

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.590
I h-had no idea...

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.130
yours were that big!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:30.310
Wait a second... Are you...

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:34.390
I've never been with a man.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.270
Which means...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.580
You're a virgin!

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:42.470
<i>Susanoo is shown to have an unknown power,</i>

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:47.460
<i>and another virgin, this time a woman 
dressed as a swordsman, appears.</i>

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:52.870
<i>What fate awaits the bathhouse?</i>

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:27.130
A summer festival!

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:28.610
Maybe I'll eat some dumplings!

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:31.090
Chiharu, the fireworks went up!

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:32.190
They're so pretty.

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:33.880
You're wide open! Smooch!

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:35.540
What are you doing, virgin?

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:37.400
Next time, another big fireworks show

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Time: 
Later Summer in Nagasaki, 
on the Night the Lanterns Float</b>

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.290
that'll decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:39.410
Let's do this!
